Krita brush engine port — src/tools/krita/
------------------------------------------
The code under src/tools/krita/ is a close port of parts of Krita 5.2
(https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita): the pixel brush paintop, its
options and sensors, brush tips, dab caching and the 8-bit composite ops it
paints through. That source is licensed GPL-2.0-or-later (a few files
LGPL-2.0/2.1-or-later), and a translation of it is a derivative work.

It also ports Qt 5.15's raster image scaling and drawing routines
(qtbase, https://code.qt.io/qt/qtbase.git), licensed LGPL-3.0 / GPL-2.0 /
GPL-3.0.

UNRESOLVED: distributing a build that contains this code under MIT OR
Apache-2.0 alone is not compatible with those licenses. Decide the licensing
(for example GPL-3.0-or-later for the whole app, or removing the port)
before any binary or source release.

Krita brush resources — src/tools/krita/assets/
-----------------------------------------------
The brush presets and tips there are copied unchanged from Krita's
Krita_4_Default_Resources.bundle, whose meta.xml gives the author as
"Deevad with derivations of the brushes of Ramon Miranda, Razvanc, Radian,
Wolthera, Storm, Scottyp and other" and the license as CC-0.
